      "content": "wait wow okay that sounds scary. but i dont really have insurance that covers emergency visits well and i'm way too tired to drive anywhere right now. can i just sleep it off and take some ibuprofen instead? like if i just keep my leg elevated and rest i'll be fine by morning right?",
